<title>UK: Invesco Plc completes merger with AIM.</title>
<headline>Invesco Plc completes merger with AIM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British investment management company Invesco Plc said on Sunday its merger with U.S. group AIM Management Group Inc was completed on February 28.</p>
<p>The consideration for the merger was satisfied by the issue of 290 million ordinary shares of Invesco to existing shareholders of AIM shares, Invesco said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;With this merger of equals, Invesco and AIM have created an investment management firm with global reach,&quot; Charles Brady, Invesco, chairman said in a statement.</p>
</text>
